# Plan: Aesthetic Overhaul & Social Fix

This plan outlines a complete visual redesign of GoHabit to provide a "Premium" and "Wowed" experience, while ensuring the new Social/Comunidad section is properly integrated and visible.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I will replace the current emoji-based navigation with high-quality Material Symbols and a floating glassmorphism design. This will significantly change the look and feel to be more modern.

## Proposed Changes

### Design System (CSS)

#### [MODIFY] [app.css](file:///c:/Users/Estudio/OneDrive%20-%20UFV/Documentos/3%20CARRERA/PROYECTOS/GRUPO_05_GoHabit_Proyecto/GoHabit-system/frontend/css/app.css)
- Define a modern, harmonious color palette (HSL-based).
- Implement global glassmorphism utility classes (`.gh-glass`).
- redesign the `.index-nav` to be a floating pill bar with better hover/active states.
- Improve desktop layout: Center the application in a "Mobile-First but Desktop-Friendly" frame.

#### [MODIFY] [social.css](file:///c:/Users/Estudio/OneDrive%20-%20UFV/Documentos/3%20CARRERA/PROYECTOS/GRUPO_05_GoHabit_Proyecto/GoHabit-system/frontend/css/social.css)
- Update feed cards and friend lists to match the new design system.

### Frontend Templates (HTML)

#### [MODIFY] All Templates (index, habitos, avatar, perfil, tienda, social, anadirHabito, calendario)
- Standardize the navigation bar structure.
- **CRITICAL FIX**: Re-add the "Comunidad" link to ensure it's present across all pages.
- Standardize the Header structure to use the new premium styles.

### Assets & Visuals

#### [NEW] UI Assets
- Use `generate_image` if needed for background textures or placeholder avatars to make the initial view stunning.

## Open Questions

- **Navigation Style**: Do you prefer the navigation bar fixed at the bottom (mobile-app style) or a floating pill that hides on scroll? (Assuming fixed pill for now).
- **Icons**: Should I use Material Symbols (Google) or FontAwesome style icons? (Assuming Material for consistency).

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- I will use the browser tool to:
